"# Holographic Topology Engine: Telemetry & Invariant Analysis\n",
"This notebook provides automated ingest, statistical analysis, and publication-ready visualization (APS/Physical Review style) for JSON telemetry data exported from the Holographic Topology Engine testing suite."
]
